{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the head of the most monstrous industry !</strong><br>You\u2019ve just been promoted to CEO of a rather unusual factory: your workers are monsters, your machines are hungry for ore, and your currency of choice is called <strong>Monstercoins</strong>. With Elias, your ever-enthusiastic (and sarcastic) right-hand man, you\u2019ll turn a pile of dusty scrap metal into an unshakable industrial empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission ? <strong>Produce, optimize, and innovate\u2026 while surviving the unexpected.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>An empire that starts small\u2026 and grows colossal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a handful of underpaid monsters and one squeaky machine. But with a bit of flair (and a lot of Monstercoins), everything can change :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit and train your monsters\u00a0</strong>: each comes with their own strengths, moods, and productivity. It\u2019s up to you to put them in the right role.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and upgrade your machines\u00a0</strong>: every upgrade makes the factory rumble and multiplies your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate your production chain\u00a0</strong>: watch ores turn into ingots, then finished products\u2014almost without lifting a finger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/93d27be92d9a2cc1222d81db3d1321be.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"A business that&#039;s doing well\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/93d27be92d9a2cc1222d81db3d1321be.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/93d27be92d9a2cc1222d81db3d1321be.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Elias, your right-hand man (and reluctant tutor)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elias is with you from day one: he explains, he grumbles, he jokes\u2026 but he\u2019s indispensable. The true memory of the company, he\u2019ll teach you how to survive in this joyful industrial chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Management, setbacks, and decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industry is never smooth sailing\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positive events</strong> can boost your production or reveal unique opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware of <strong>breakdowns, sabotage, or price spikes</strong> that can throw your plans into disarray.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly, adjust your choices, and turn every problem into an opportunity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/dee431abe8c56ed0bd54a8af9f674c5d.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"The breakdown of the machines\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/dee431abe8c56ed0bd54a8af9f674c5d.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/dee431abe8c56ed0bd54a8af9f674c5d.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2c <strong>Research &amp; Development: expand your empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to <strong>R&amp;D</strong>, your factory is constantly evolving :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock brand-new machines and technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production floor to host more and more lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique synergies to dominate the market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/9a2e235750228b0b0ac4a504346ea52e.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"Research and development\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/9a2e235750228b0b0ac4a504346ea52e.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/9a2e235750228b0b0ac4a504346ea52e.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Monstercoins: the lifeblood of your company</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every product, every upgrade, every decision is paid for, and rewarded, with Monstercoins. Hoarding this currency isn\u2019t just about profit : it\u2019s a philosophy. The more your conveyors run, the more your empire sparkles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>financial markets</strong> and use your influence to boost profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>delivery missions</strong> for prestigious clients to earn a rewarding bonus.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A living world around your factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factory isn\u2019t alone in the void :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passersby</strong> roam the streets, bringing life to your industrial district.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>day/night cycle</strong> transforms the atmosphere and lights up the factory in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in and you\u2019ll hear machines pounding in immersive 3D audio, even though the game is in 2D.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/19f8df686eabe1df671346284679a033.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"Earn monstercoins\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/19f8df686eabe1df671346284679a033.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/19f8df686eabe1df671346284679a033.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>An atmosphere you can hear as much as you can play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in 2D, your factory sounds like a living world :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rumble of machines,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clattering of conveyors,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sighs of your monster workers\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything contributes to the immersion of a unique industrial universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>In short, Idle Tycoon Manufacturing is\u2026</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky industrial management game where your workers are monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines to build, upgrade, and automate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system of positive and negative events that shake up your plans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete R&amp;D system to grow and diversify your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living, immersive world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all\u2026 <strong>tons of Monstercoins raining down!</strong></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Good Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/0cb5bafa01e83a0d1473d02f396a773c1884a052.jpg"},{"name":"Repairman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/3e69e7947aad180a9fbe1253259cdf9c3ae5b134.jpg"},{"name":"100 bucks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/412d1222e2c73d5b0d7cb753ad63b9d37857f960.jpg"},{"name":"10K coins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/0d599c3fcfd6dadb97a932b6299e73fb0bfcd2af.jpg"},{"name":"100M cash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/8bffa54473f2c5ec635adf76ac3ff4cbd04d35a0.jpg"},{"name":"10B dough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/58620559c14643040ed86c9a683b7b0bb81f7303.jpg"},{"name":"100T green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/04f80c741c1bb0c704eb3342f91185c6359fd978.jpg"},{"name":"10Qa bread","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/aa101daba911e404313a497bdf0c51af3c0e6eb8.jpg"},{"name":"100Qi loot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/d887f576eca7a37e8f3fbbd1c9644a7083ba5d44.jpg"},{"name":"10Sx stash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3913140/3d9324c0a62eb44dde57ffc1c2834aef088d9020.jpg"}],"total":79},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3913140?t=1769183611","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/39131