in your monsters\u00a0</strong>: each comes with their own strengths, moods, and productivity. It\u2019s up to you to put them in the right role.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and upgrade your machines\u00a0</strong>: every upgrade makes the factory rumble and multiplies your profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate your production chain\u00a0</strong>: watch ores turn into ingots, then finished products\u2014almost without lifting a finger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/93d27be92d9a2cc1222d81db3d1321be.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"A business that&#039;s doing well\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/93d27be92d9a2cc1222d81db3d1321be.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/93d27be92d9a2cc1222d81db3d1321be.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Elias, your right-hand man (and reluctant tutor)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elias is with you from day one: he explains, he grumbles, he jokes\u2026 but he\u2019s indispensable. The true memory of the company, he\u2019ll teach you how to survive in this joyful industrial chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Management, setbacks, and decisions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industry is never smooth sailing\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positive events</strong> can boost your production or reveal unique opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware of <strong>breakdowns, sabotage, or price spikes</strong> that can throw your plans into disarray.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React quickly, adjust your choices, and turn every problem into an opportunity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/dee431abe8c56ed0bd54a8af9f674c5d.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"The breakdown of the machines\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/dee431abe8c56ed0bd54a8af9f674c5d.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/dee431abe8c56ed0bd54a8af9f674c5d.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd2c <strong>Research &amp; Development: expand your empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to <strong>R&amp;D</strong>, your factory is constantly evolving :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock brand-new machines and technologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production floor to host more and more lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique synergies to dominate the market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/9a2e235750228b0b0ac4a504346ea52e.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"Research and development\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/9a2e235750228b0b0ac4a504346ea52e.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/9a2e235750228b0b0ac4a504346ea52e.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Monstercoins: the lifeblood of your company</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every product, every upgrade, every decision is paid for, and rewarded, with Monstercoins. Hoarding this currency isn\u2019t just about profit : it\u2019s a philosophy. The more your conveyors run, the more your empire sparkles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>financial markets</strong> and use your influence to boost profits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>delivery missions</strong> for prestigious clients to earn a rewarding bonus.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A living world around your factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your factory isn\u2019t alone in the void :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passersby</strong> roam the streets, bringing life to your industrial district.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>day/night cycle</strong> transforms the atmosphere and lights up the factory in new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom in and you\u2019ll hear machines pounding in immersive 3D audio, even though the game is in 2D.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/19f8df686eabe1df671346284679a033.poster.avif?t=1769183611\" aria-label=\"Earn monstercoins\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/19f8df686eabe1df671346284679a033.webm?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/extras/19f8df686eabe1df671346284679a033.mp4?t=1769183611\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>An atmosphere you can hear as much as you can play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in 2D, your factory sounds like a living world :</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rumble of machines,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clattering of conveyors,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sighs of your monster workers\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything contributes to the immersion of a unique industrial universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 <strong>In short, Idle Tycoon Manufacturing is\u2026</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quirky industrial management game where your workers are monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines to build, upgrade, and automate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system of positive and negative events that shake up your plans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete R&amp;D system to grow and diversify your factory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living, immersive world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all\u2026 <strong>tons of Monstercoins raining down!</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Eragone"],"dlc":[4072430],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3913140/d9838478e1a8ccb68567998d6fc4fb858926101b/header.jpg?t=1769183611","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04 or equivalent (64-bit system)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><st